<title>UK: Psion down 80p at 425p on trading update.</title>
<headline>Psion down 80p at 425p on trading update.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares Psion Plc on Monday opened some 15 percent or 80 pence lower at 425 pence after the group said its performance would be affected until its new Series 5 handheld computer becomes established.</p>
</text>
